53e34808854c.plain:
While your army's active doctrine is the Devastator Doctrine:
• your RAVENWING models add 3" to their Move characteristic;
• your RAVENWING units are still eligible to shoot in a turn in which they Advanced, but a ranged attack made by a model that Advanced this turn takes the hit roll penalty it would take if it were an Assault weapon.

7eeb4352225e.plain:
Malediction, warp charge 6. If it is manifested, choose an enemy unit within 24" of this PSYKER. These effects last until your next Psychic phase starts:
• while that unit is within 6" of this PSYKER, the Attacks characteristic of its models drops by 1;
• every attack made by a model in that unit has 1 subtracted from its hit roll.

c3e58496ede3.plain:
In your Command phase, you can pick one of your DARK ANGELS units within 6" of this WARLORD. Until your next Command phase starts, for every attack made by a model in that unit:
• if your army's active doctrine is the Tactical Doctrine, treat the Devastator Doctrine as active for that attack instead;
• if your army's active doctrine is the Assault Doctrine, treat the Tactical Doctrine as active for that attack instead.

d8d1e5324c00.plain:
Malediction, warp charge 7. If it is manifested, choose an enemy unit within 24" of this PSYKER. These effects last until your next Psychic phase starts:
• its models' Leadership characteristic is reduced by 1;
• it can't use Objective Secured, or any similar ability letting it control an objective marker however many enemy models are in range of that marker;
• if your Psychic test result was equal to or greater than its Leadership, it can't perform actions (an action it is performing right now fails immediately).
